{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/437489-irraka-gift-divide-and-conquer","id":437489,"title":"Irraka Gift: Divide and Conquer","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-11T13:54:25-07:00","id":437489,"title":"Irraka Gift: Divide and Conquer","content":"I want to discuss this one because I find it odd: while applying the Lured Condition to a victim is indeed a useful trick to split the party (never mind it doesn\u00b4t prevent any other member of the group to accompany the target regardless of his/her wishes), DaC is indeed very weak for a four dot level gift.<br /> I would rather leave it as a first-two level dot, and create a new four-dot one. Example: &quot;<b><i>Mark of the Prey</i></b>&quot;: Effect: halves the Initiative, Defense and Speed of the victim for as many turns as the number of successes (or the entire scene).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2411,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","user":"Raistlin","date":". 03-11-2015, 04:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T14:03:49-07:00","id":437508,"title":"","content":"'If allies who are not Lured notice what she is doing and try to get her to stay with the group, she will give the best argument she can as to why they should let her split off, and attempts to convince her otherwise suffer a \u20135 penalty.'<br /> <br /> That probably counts for preventing other members. That said, it can be particularly powerful ability, allowing people who would normally not go apart from one another to be separated. I think the fun thing about this is that it's more of a plot device than a numerical disruption. You could use it to lure a guard away from who they're guarding, the protected one away on their own, someone on the other side you need to talk to privately without anyone else knowing, it adds options for stealth and ambushing and distraction. There's a lot you can do with it, and the inability to resist makes it far more powerful than a regular attempt at distraction.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T14:16:13-07:00","id":437525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Raistlin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/437489-irraka-gift-divide-and-conquer#post437489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want to discuss this one because I find it odd: while applying the Lured Condition to a victim is indeed a useful trick to split the party (never mind it doesn\u00b4t prevent any other member of the group to accompany the target regardless of his/her wishes), DaC is indeed very weak for a four dot level gift.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026&quot;The Irraka may use this Facet on a single individual whom he can see and who is part of a group. The Irraka has to supply some sort of distraction of movement or sound as part of the Facet, but <b>it can be incredibly minor and </b><b><b>only the chosen target w</b>ill notice it</b> \u2014 at least at first.&quot;<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> &quot;She will move away from a group of allies who are not also Lured<b> without informing them</b>; calling for back-up won\u2019t even cross her mind until an actual threat makes itself real.&quot;<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> &quot;If allies who are not Lured notice what she is doing and try to get her to stay with the group, <b>she will give the best argument she can as to why they should let her split off,</b> and attempts to convince her otherwise suffer a \u20135 penalty. <b>Attempts to forcibly restrain her or prevent her from going will likely convince her that something is wrong with her allies</b> \u2014 they\u2019re being blinded to the danger that she has to check out, or they\u2019re going mad and they\u2019re now a danger that she needs to get away from. <b>She will attempt to do so as intelligently as she can.</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> Very weak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T19:03:42-07:00","id":437879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/437489-irraka-gift-divide-and-conquer?p=437525#post437525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026&quot;The Irraka may use this Facet on a single individual whom he can see and who is part of a group. The Irraka has to supply some sort of distraction of movement or sound as part of the Facet, but <b>it can be incredibly minor and </b><b><b>only the chosen target w</b>ill notice it</b> \u2014 at least at first.&quot;<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> &quot;She will move away from a group of allies who are not also Lured<b> without informing them</b>; calling for back-up won\u2019t even cross her mind until an actual threat makes itself real.&quot;<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> &quot;If allies who are not Lured notice what she is doing and try to get her to stay with the group, <b>she will give the best argument she can as to why they should let her split off,</b> and attempts to convince her otherwise suffer a \u20135 penalty. <b>Attempts to forcibly restrain her or prevent her from going will likely convince her that something is wrong with her allies</b> \u2014 they\u2019re being blinded to the danger that she has to check out, or they\u2019re going mad and they\u2019re now a danger that she needs to get away from. <b>She will attempt to do so as intelligently as she can.</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> Very weak.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Uhh... you just highlighted all the best parts of the ability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T20:28:36-07:00","id":437956,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure the &quot;very weak&quot; there is sarcastic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T10:03:07-07:00","id":438617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/437489-irraka-gift-divide-and-conquer?p=437956#post437956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm pretty sure the &quot;very weak&quot; there is sarcastic.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I was apparently taking a dramatic failure for a Beat on my Empathy + Composure roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T16:34:32-07:00","id":439037,"title":"","content":"Divide and Conquer is amazing. It's the staple Irraka ability to basically take entire groups down one by one. Add a couple of Stealth facets and you'll terrify the bejesus of special forces and scar them for life (assuming said life lasts more than it's gonna take for sun-rise).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T16:41:17-07:00","id":439045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/437489-irraka-gift-divide-and-conquer?p=437525#post437525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026&quot;The Irraka may use this Facet on a single individual whom he can see and who is part of a group. The Irraka has to supply some sort of distraction of movement or sound as part of the Facet, but <b>it can be incredibly minor and </b><b><b>only the chosen target w</b>ill notice it</b> \u2014 at least at first.&quot;<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> &quot;She will move away from a group of allies who are not also Lured<b> without informing them</b>; calling for back-up won\u2019t even cross her mind until an actual threat makes itself real.&quot;<br /> <br /> [\u2026]<br /> <br /> &quot;If allies who are not Lured notice what she is doing and try to get her to stay with the group, <b>she will give the best argument she can as to why they should let her split off,</b> and attempts to convince her otherwise suffer a \u20135 penalty. <b>Attempts to forcibly restrain her or prevent her from going will likely convince her that something is wrong with her allies</b> \u2014 they\u2019re being blinded to the danger that she has to check out, or they\u2019re going mad and they\u2019re now a danger that she needs to get away from. <b>She will attempt to do so as intelligently as she can.</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> Very weak.</div> </div> </div> </div>Step into my parlor?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T18:37:40-07:00","id":439186,"title":"","content":"Don't forget Primal Allure, which allow you to get a perfect impression and bonus dice (or auto-successes) to any attempt to convince the target of simple, immediate actions. Like... step into this dark alley with me stranger. :-D<br /> <br /> Or force breaking points if you exceptionally succeed. Bwahahhaha!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5292-flailbot","name":"FlailBot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}